 "nl": [
  "Any zone may connect to edge-cache over HTTPS (TCP 443) and DNS over UDP 53.",
  "Hosts in backup may reach database over PostgreSQL (TCP 5432) and RTSP (TCP 554) and IMAP (TCP 143).",
  "Any zone may connect to engineering over HTTP (TCP 80).",
  "edge-cache must accept DNS over UDP 53 from cameras.",
  "Apart from cameras on HTTPS (TCP 443); edge-cache on HTTPS (TCP 443), all traffic originating in printers must be dropped.",
  "Any zone may connect to printers over DNS over UDP 53 and HTTPS (TCP 443).",
  "nvr may use TCP ports 1024-65535 towards printers, except MySQL (TCP 3306), RDP (TCP 3389), PostgreSQL (TCP 5432), which must be blocked.",
  "Allow finance to connect to engineering using RTSP (TCP 554).",
  "Allow nvr to connect to partners using PostgreSQL (TCP 5432).",
  "finance must never reach partners, regardless of any other rule.",
  "Allow finance to connect to cameras using syslog (UDP 514) and DNS over UDP 53.",
  "Permit TCP ports 1024-65535 from engineering to backup but deny MySQL (TCP 3306), PostgreSQL (TCP 5432), RDP (TCP 3389).",
  "partners is isolated: it may only reach mail on DNS over UDP 53, and nothing else.",
  "database must accept NTP (UDP 123) and SMTP (TCP 25) from finance.",
  "Allow backup to connect to finance using HTTPS (TCP 443).",
  "engineering offers HTTP (TCP 80) and NTP (UDP 123) to every zone."
 ],
